{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2768030/extras/cc9a90708e82c9521b8d7f6f9ba49e4e.poster.avif?t=1772550686\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2768030/extras/cc9a90708e82c9521b8d7f6f9ba49e4e.webm?t=1772550686\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2768030/extras/cc9a90708e82c9521b8d7f6f9ba49e4e.mp4?t=1772550686\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Saborus is a thrilling horror adventure in which you guide a brave chicken through a deadly slaughterhouse where everything wants to kill you! You, as the chicken, will solve puzzles and face the relentless pursuit of the Saborus slaughterhouse workers. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Make your way through the sinister surroundings of a creepy slaughterhouse, full of suspense and surprises! Can you survive?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2768030/extras/4e35fa7e3ddff59559c5e069169978fd.poster.avif?t=1772550686\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2768030/extras/4e35fa7e3ddff59559c5e069169978fd.webm?t=1772550686\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2768030/extras/4e35fa7e3ddff59559c5e069169978fd.mp4?t=1772550686\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Saborus promises an immersive and spine-chilling horror gam